{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09016","headline":"赠冯着 · 韦应物","name":"赠冯着","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"契阔仕两京，念子亦飘蓬。\n方来属追往，十载事不同。\n岁晏乃云至，微褐还未充。\n惨凄游子情，风雪自关东。\n华觞发懽颜，嘉藻播清风。\n始此盈抱恨，旷然一夕中。\n善蕴岂轻售，怀才希国工。\n谁当念素士，零落岁华空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09016.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09016","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}